3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$776</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.3.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">February 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Teddy</b> is a decoration item that is no longer available for purchase. The item was sold at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> for $776 and was added for a limited time as part of Version 1.3.0 (The Valentine's Day update).\n</p><p>It normally comes in brown when unboxed; however, there is a 1-in-10 chance for it to be pink.\n</p><p>The Pink Teddy has an additional “Pat” option, which will play one of a few possible voice lines, saying one of the following: “I need a hug,” “I love you,” “I love spending time with you,” “Let’s be friends” or “Will you be my friend?”\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The Teddy is a small light brown teddy bear with black eyes. The model used for it is the Roblox gear item \"Teddy Bloxpin.\"\n</p><p>The Pink Teddy is the same as the normal one, except it takes on a unique pink texture with a red heart on its chest.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This was one of the first items to have a rare variant.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903042012\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 76/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 582/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 102/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019424/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.006      1 -total\n 96.18%   48.094      1 Template:Objects\n  3.66%    1.831      1 Template:Trade-only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:661-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903042012 and revision id 17469. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Limited","Items","Event_Items"],"links":[{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":["Teddy_Unboxed.png","Teddy.png","TeddyPink.png"]}
